<!-- QuillPost adaptive-icon foreground: the suite's icon-foreground.svg (white letter card with
     the envelope flap and the white quill), converted path for path. The SVG draws the 512-unit
     artwork scaled by 0.6 around the centre, which keeps the quill tip inside the 66dp safe
     circle; the group below does the same. The tile colour is the background layer
     (@color/ic_launcher_background). -->
